[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1080","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1080.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1364","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 本地拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Windows NT 4.0 系统内核中存在拒绝服务漏洞，本地用户可通过向 GetThreadContext 或 SetThreadContext 函数传递非法的内核模式地址，导致系统崩溃。该漏洞为本地利用，攻击者需拥有系统本地访问权限，无法远程触发。CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。受影响的系统为 Windows NT 4.0，微软已发布安全更新修复此问题。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1364"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:16Z","remediation":"Windows NT 4.0 已停止技术支持，该漏洞无官方补丁。建议将系统升级至 Windows 10/11 或 Windows Server 2016+ 等受支持版本以彻底修复。如无法升级，可通过组策略限制本地用户交互式登录权限，仅允许授权管理员登录，降低本地攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/support/kb/articles/q142/6/53.asp","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7421.php","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/41de94138b7cf6e858138ec4e79e16fbec611fa4/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1364.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1364","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1364.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/175fba1f481a7f7cf5bdb5344d3c0e47af1884ef/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1364.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa37ed0317ce1265b487f92916077b9ccbfe3349/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-h9g2-x4rf-46v3/GHSA-h9g2-x4rf-46v3.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x85000/84476/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1364.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153900_154000.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/8108bbe4fb0e20671face287a302a062844c09bb/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1080.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1079","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1079.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1363","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 本地拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Windows NT 3.51 及 4.0 系统中存在资源耗尽型拒绝服务漏洞。本地攻击者可通过运行恶意程序，对同一文件创建大量文件锁，消耗系统非分页池（NonPagedPool）内存资源，导致内核资源耗尽、系统崩溃。该漏洞仅需低权限本地访问即可触发，无需用户交互，影响所有 Windows NT 3.51 及 4.0 版本。CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1363"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:16Z","remediation":"升级到受支持的现代 Windows 版本（如 Windows 10/11 或 Windows Server 2019+），Windows NT 3.51/4.0 已停止支持且不再发布安全更新。如无法升级，限制本地用户登录权限，仅允许受信任用户操作，并通过系统监视器监控异常的文件锁创建行为作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/support/kb/articles/q163/1/43.asp","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7405.php","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/41de94138b7cf6e858138ec4e79e16fbec611fa4/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1363.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1363","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1363.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/175fba1f481a7f7cf5bdb5344d3c0e47af1884ef/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1363.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa37ed0317ce1265b487f92916077b9ccbfe3349/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-r2f7-pcrq-mgm9/GHSA-r2f7-pcrq-mgm9.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x85000/84483/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1363.json","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-410.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1079.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1077","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1077.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1360","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 内核句柄操作本地拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Windows NT 4.0 存在内核句柄处理缺陷，本地用户可通过用户态应用程序关闭一个在内核模式下打开的句柄，当内核尝试关闭该句柄时触发双重释放，导致系统崩溃引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 4.0 系统，攻击者需拥有本地访问权限，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。微软至今未发布官方补丁，建议用户限制本地用户权限以降低风险。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1360"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:16Z","remediation":"升级至 Windows NT 4.0 Service Pack 6a 或更高版本（若已安装 SP6a，则安装 post-SP6a 安全更新）。微软已终止对 Windows NT 4.0 的支持，建议迁移至受支持的 Windows 版本（如 Windows Server 2019/2022）以持续获得安全更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/support/kb/articles/q160/6/50.asp","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7402.php","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/41de94138b7cf6e858138ec4e79e16fbec611fa4/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1360.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1360","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1360.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/175fba1f481a7f7cf5bdb5344d3c0e47af1884ef/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1360.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa37ed0317ce1265b487f92916077b9ccbfe3349/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-77p5-wxj2-c3mh/GHSA-77p5-wxj2-c3mh.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x85000/84461/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1360.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153900_154000.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/8108bbe4fb0e20671face287a302a062844c09bb/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1077.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1076","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1076.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1359","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 组策略安全绕过漏洞","description":"Windows NT 系统在处理服务器名称超过 13 个字符的 Ntconfig.pol 策略文件时存在安全绕过漏洞。由于系统对全局组策略的强制执行机制存在缺陷，当服务器名过长时，系统无法正确应用针对全局组的安全策略限制，导致本地用户能够绕过管理员设定的组策略约束，获取超出预期的系统访问权限。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 系列操作系统，攻击者只需拥有本地访问权限即可利用，无需额外认证条件。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1359"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:16Z","remediation":"将服务器名称改为不超过 13 个字符，确保 Ntconfig.pol 策略文件对全局组正确生效；升级至 Windows 2000 或更高版本以彻底修复此策略绕过问题。若无法升级，在组策略中手动审查全局组成员权限作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/support/kb/articles/q163/8/75.asp","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7401.php","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/41de94138b7cf6e858138ec4e79e16fbec611fa4/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1359.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1359","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1359.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/175fba1f481a7f7cf5bdb5344d3c0e47af1884ef/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1359.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa37ed0317ce1265b487f92916077b9ccbfe3349/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7hww-85g7-g9hc/GHSA-7hww-85g7-g9hc.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87900/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1359.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153900_154000.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/8108bbe4fb0e20671face287a302a062844c09bb/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1076.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1072","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1072.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1355","title":"BMC Patrol 默认口令配置漏洞","description":"Compaq Insight Management Agent 4.23及之前版本、Management Agents for Servers 4.40及之前版本在安装BMC Patrol组件时，会创建一个名为PFCUser的默认账户，该账户使用固定默认密码且拥有潜在危险权限。远程攻击者可利用该默认账户登录系统，获取未授权访问权限，进而执行任意操作。此漏洞属于弱配置缺陷，影响大量使用Compaq管理代理的服务器系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1355"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:15Z","remediation":"立即修改 PFCUser 账户的默认密码为强口令，或删除该默认账户；升级 Compaq Insight Management Agent 至 4.24 及以上版本，或 Management Agents for Servers 至 4.41 及以上版本；在防火墙层面限制对管理端口的访问，仅允许受信任 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=93542118727732&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=93654336516711&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=93759822430801&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=94183795025294&w=2","http://www.compaq.com/products/servers/management/advisory.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3231","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/63f7cdb3d3ebf7bfe8ef6a2325af30a024b23325/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1355.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1355","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1355.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/175fba1f481a7f7cf5bdb5344d3c0e47af1884ef/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1355.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa37ed0317ce1265b487f92916077b9ccbfe3349/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-qmhx-84gq-mqf3/GHSA-qmhx-84gq-mqf3.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87874/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1355.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--203e8cbd-6b3c-4878-8673-6db7c739ac0c.json","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-1999.jsonl","https://github.com/SecurityTapestry-Queen/nvd-cve-api-search/blob/4a5d74092248886d53e4caf25d3ecb02275f388b/archive/2025-04-06/report-04-06-2025-20-58-46.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1072.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1055","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1055.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1339","title":"Linux Kernel 和 FreeBSD NAT 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"当 Linux 2.2.10 及更早版本（使用 ipchains）或 FreeBSD 3.2（使用 ipfw）启用网络地址转换（NAT）功能时，存在一个拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标发送带有记录路由选项的 ping 请求（ping -R），触发内核在处理 IP 记录路由选项时的异常，导致目标系统内核崩溃（kernel panic），造成服务不可用。该漏洞利用条件简单，无需认证即可远程触发，影响范围包括运行上述版本 Linux 和 FreeBSD 且启用 NAT 功能的系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1339"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:13Z","remediation":"Linux 用户应将内核升级至 2.2.11 或更高版本（patch-2.2.11.gz 已修复 ipchains NAT 下 ping -R 导致的内核崩溃）；FreeBSD 用户应升级至 3.3 或更高版本。临时缓解措施：在 ipchains 或 ipfw 规则中丢弃携带记录路由（record-route）选项的 ICMP 数据包，或禁用 NAT 功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=93277426802802&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=93277766505061&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7257.php","http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v2.2/patch-2.2.11.gz","http://www.osvdb.org/6105","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0b8e5ca8c68c148c2498e70421f33344e9cff1e8/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1339.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1339","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1339.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/376d7933ee02aeea89711d9c7726aad7f10e0a2a/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1339.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/491d1a908ffff7b174e17aaac4d0207c13405fa7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8m8f-vqxq-q9r6/GHSA-8m8f-vqxq-q9r6.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87884/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153900_154000.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--4321c2f2-9dc5-429a-bd37-0385455013c1.json","https://github.com/shamedgh/confine/blob/a75dad3ad336e6258a42cd1ce4af061eea68ed76/cve.files/cveToFile.json.type.csv","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1339.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1055.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1051","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1051.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1335","title":"Red Hat Linux snmpd 服务器配置错误漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 4.0 中 cmu-snmp SNMP 软件包 3.3-1 之前版本的 snmpd 服务器存在配置错误漏洞。由于默认配置不当，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可利用 SNMP 协议的读写权限（public/private 团体字串）访问目标系统，读取或修改敏感系统信息，可能导致配置泄露或系统被篡改。该漏洞危害等级为中危，CVSS 评分 6.4，建议升级至 cmu-snmp 3.3-1 或更高版本以修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1335"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:13Z","remediation":"升级 cmu-snmp 软件包至 3.3-1 或更高版本，同时修改 /etc/snmpd.conf 配置文件中默认的 public/private community 字符串为复杂随机值，并在 iptables 防火墙中限制 SNMP（UDP 161/162 端口）仅允许受信管理主机访问。禁用 SNMP 读写权限（将 snmpd.conf 中 rwcommunity 项改为 rocommunity），如无需使用则直接停止 snmpd 服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/rh40-errata-general.html#cmu-snmp","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7251","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0b8e5ca8c68c148c2498e70421f33344e9cff1e8/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1335.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1335","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1335.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/376d7933ee02aeea89711d9c7726aad7f10e0a2a/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1335.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/491d1a908ffff7b174e17aaac4d0207c13405fa7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-pr33-x2p7-6w2x/GHSA-pr33-x2p7-6w2x.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1335.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153900_154000.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001032.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--54c919b9-3bdc-4906-ba93-56a73c55a239.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1051.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1050","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1050.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1334","title":"Elm 2.4 缓冲区溢出代码执行漏洞","description":"Elm 2.4 版本中的 filter 命令存在多处缓冲区溢出漏洞。攻击者可通过向受害者发送包含超长 From 头或 Reply-To 头的恶意邮件，或通过提供超长 -f (filterfile) 命令行参数来触发缓冲区溢出，从而执行任意命令。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，受影响系统包括使用 Elm 2.4 邮件客户端的各类 Unix/Linux 平台。建议用户升级至更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1334"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:13Z","remediation":"建议升级至 Elm 2.5 或更高版本（若可用），或迁移至现代邮件客户端如 Mutt、Alpine 等。临时缓解：禁用 Elm 的 filter 命令功能，避免处理超长 From:/Reply-To: 头或 -f 参数，并在邮件网关层面过滤异常长度的邮件头。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=88609666024181&w=2","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/rh50-errata-general.html#elm","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/1999/CVE-1999-1334.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0b8e5ca8c68c148c2498e70421f33344e9cff1e8/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1334.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1334","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/376d7933ee02aeea89711d9c7726aad7f10e0a2a/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1334.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-1334.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/491d1a908ffff7b174e17aaac4d0207c13405fa7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9pwm-wh34-fpxm/GHSA-9pwm-wh34-fpxm.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1334.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001031.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1334.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1050.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1049","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1049.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1333","title":"Red Hat Linux ncFTP 客户端命令执行漏洞","description":"ncFTP 2.4.2 FTP 客户端在 Red Hat Linux 5.0 及更早版本中存在操作系统命令注入漏洞。当用户使用自动下载选项时，远程攻击者可通过在待下载文件名中嵌入 shell 元字符（如 `;`、`|`、`` ` `` 等）来执行任意系统命令。该漏洞利用条件简单，攻击者只需控制 FTP 服务器上文件名即可触发，危害等级高，可能导致目标主机被完全控制。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1333"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:13Z","remediation":"升级 ncftp 至 3.0.0 或更高版本，新版本已对自动下载的文件名进行 shell 元字符转义处理。如无法升级，可在 ncftp 配置中关闭自动下载功能（`set auto-download off`），并避免使用通配符或未验证来源的远程文件。对于 Red Hat Linux 5.0，建议升级操作系统以获取完整的 ncftp 补丁支持。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=89042322924057&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7240.php","http://www.osvdb.org/6111","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/rh50-errata-general.html#ncftp","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0b8e5ca8c68c148c2498e70421f33344e9cff1e8/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1333.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1333","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1333.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/929f101fd7b4d4314a4b92f62a8cc2523c6d76f0/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1333.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/491d1a908ffff7b174e17aaac4d0207c13405fa7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9h2r-7wfr-mg4j/GHSA-9h2r-7wfr-mg4j.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153900_154000.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1333.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001030.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--5887413c-ae64-4bb2-b0f9-32f31f8899ff.json","https://github.com/dong-xs/Vul-PAG/blob/7eb3b32094a5270cfd8495366e0e4a7df5a874ce/aspect_prediction/org_pred_diff.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1049.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1048","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1048.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1332","title":"GNU gzip gzexe 不安全的临时文件创建漏洞","description":"GNU gzip 软件包中的 gzexe 工具在处理可执行文件时使用了不安全的临时文件创建方式，将临时文件创建在可预测的目录路径下。本地攻击者可利用符号链接（symlink）攻击，在目标用户执行 gzexe 前创建指向其他用户文件的符号链接，从而导致任意文件被覆盖或破坏。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Linux 5.0 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低，触发条件要求攻击者拥有本地账号访问权限。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1332"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:12Z","remediation":"升级 gzip 软件包至包含暂时文件安全创建的版本（如 1.2.4 以上），或升级 Red Hat Linux 至 5.0 以上版本。如无法升级，设置环境变量 TMPDIR 为仅 root 可写的目录，限制本地普通用户创建符号链接攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=88603844115233&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-308","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7241.php","http://www.osvdb.org/3812","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/rh50-errata-general.html#gzip","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/7845","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/1999/CVE-1999-1332.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e452a37e644e8194f1171b7eec1f7dc625b6526/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1332.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1332","https://github.com/kubescape/kubescape/blob/9ea839a5c7542bcfc294605ef25a52612e868887/core/pkg/containerscan/jsonrawscan.go","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d880529b2028116bddf6c732baf8f599b169f01e/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1332.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-1332.md","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-308.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-px52-rq5c-w9gw/GHSA-px52-rq5c-w9gw.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/mandrake_MDKSA-2003-068.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2004/CVE-2004-0603.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1048.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-1048.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1048.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1047","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1047.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1331","title":"Red Hat Linux netcfg 本地拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 4.2 中的 netcfg 2.16-1 存在安全配置缺陷，当特定选项被设置后，系统重启时以太网接口的访问权限控制不当，导致本地普通用户能够控制并关闭网络接口，进而引发拒绝服务攻击。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Linux 4.2 系统，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低，攻击者需具有本地系统访问权限方可利用。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1331"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:12Z","remediation":"升级至 Red Hat Linux 更新版本或迁移至现代 RHEL 发行版（如 RHEL 7/8/9），该漏洞在后续版本中已修复。如无法升级，可移除 netcfg 软件包（rpm -e netcfg）或限制 /etc/sysconfig/network-scripts/ 目录权限为仅 root 可写（chmod 700 /etc/sysconfig/network-scripts），防止普通用户重启时控制网络接口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7245.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/rh42-errata-general.html#netcfg","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50269681ee58c9b5bf7169b73546eef94697389c/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1331.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1331","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1331.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4631642e37ce9ee8b9057e387df4aee61487fb70/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1331.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f37077e857e7a28bab83d284c23299407fb1af7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-qcqp-mmmc-3pj9/GHSA-qcqp-mmmc-3pj9.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x85000/84435/info.html",