:"升级 linuxconf 至 1.11.r11-rh3 或更高版本，或直接升级 Red Hat Linux 至受支持的发行版（如 RHEL 6+）。作为临时缓解措施，限制 linuxconf 的 suid 权限：`chmod u-s /usr/bin/linuxconf` 可阻断提权路径，仅允许 root 用户执行配置管理操作。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90383955231511&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7232.php","http://www.osvdb.org/6068","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/rh51-errata-general.html#linuxconf","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d3dea9b9f675980a583148876f0551475ad122e1/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1328.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1328","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1328.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3f415771bcfb63723b9c0d3f106f197a1964d0e2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1328.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f37077e857e7a28bab83d284c23299407fb1af7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-cwr5-rx58-5m29/GHSA-cwr5-rx58-5m29.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2186/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1328.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153900_154000.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001026.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1044.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1042","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1042.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1327","title":"Red Hat Linux linuxconf 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Linuxconf 1.11r11-rh2 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，该程序在处理 LANG 环境变量时未正确检查输入长度，本地用户可通过向 LANG 环境变量传入超长字符串触发缓冲区溢出，从而获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Linux 5.1 系统，攻击者需拥有本地登录权限才能利用，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高危。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1327"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:12Z","remediation":"立即升级 linuxconf 至 Red Hat 官方修复版本（rh51-errata-general 中提供的更新 RPM），该版本已修复 LANG 环境变量缓冲区溢出问题。如无法升级，可移除 linuxconf 的 suid root 权限（chmod u-s /sbin/linuxconf）作为临时缓解措施，或直接卸载 linuxconf 改用其他系统管理工具。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90221103125826&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7239.php","http://www.osvdb.org/6065","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/rh51-errata-general.html#linuxconf","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d3dea9b9f675980a583148876f0551475ad122e1/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1327.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1327","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1327.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3f415771bcfb63723b9c0d3f106f197a1964d0e2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1327.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f37077e857e7a28bab83d284c23299407fb1af7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-m7q8-jmgx-5r5x/GHSA-m7q8-jmgx-5r5x.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1327.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153900_154000.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001025.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a5257